{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LOGIC PUZZLES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nonogram (Piczle Cross, Picross) is a puzzle game where you use logic to color squares on grids in order to reveal pictures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955030/extras/ab6ae472fec127f36a0a833ab2bb9e31.avif?t=1760106885\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BUILD YOUR FARM</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you clear puzzles, you can get coins to rescue pigs and bring them to the farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955030/extras/573465f491d7b400352c9350dd50aa35.avif?t=1760106885\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SPECIAL PIGS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are so many special pigs with special animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's collect them all !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955030/extras/dfa22318369fa20837a909b570cad816.avif?t=1760106885\" width=1560 height=650 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COZY AND RELAXING THEMES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change theme according with your mood and season.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955030/extras/a4b86ba6ddf22714dad9386ecdb23752.avif?t=1760106885\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955030/extras/ed0219aa